         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Is There a Maximum Number?\n\nIn the previous lessons, we learned that numbers originated from our bodies. We also saw that, using only hands and feet, it would be difficult to count everything.\n\nWe learned that people began to represent parts of our bodies as symbols and that, through these symbols, we could count large quantities.\n\nBut we still need to find out whether there is a limit to these counts. And this is what we will study in this lesson.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "da986842-0ca2-4c1e-93aa-83d423a6c00e",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "da986842-0ca2-4c1e-93aa-83d423a6c00e",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "thinking",
         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "We saw that numbers grow when we add digits to the left. Is there any law that prevents us from placing even more numbers to the left?",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown/html/text",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "e52b9fa6-65a2-48f3-a08f-477a24dd75f9",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": "no",
         "score": 2,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "e52b9fa6-65a2-48f3-a08f-477a24dd75f9",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "shocking",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 0,
               "uuid": "bdc3e24e-2029-4a4b-8fc3-116feed24586",
               "text": "Cahal Pech",
               "page": "https://nichbelize.org/ia-sites/cahal-pech/",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            },
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "18a901e4-3da3-45d8-a239-fb551e78698e",
               "text": "Original Text",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=7a462cd1-cfd1-4ac6-bde8-e8a64092388f",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2024",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Without Limits\n\nOur life reaches a moment when we stop growing. And, when we pour liquids into a pot, as in the image below, we cannot pour more than it can hold, or it will overflow. But, when we talk about numbers, the case is quite different.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<img src=\"https://www.historytracers.org/images/CahalPech/ChocolatPot.jpg\" />",
